OL,3,GNEWSAPunch that killed pub boss was
OL,4,A'loud and forceful'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe partner of a pub landlord who was
OL,7,Fkilled by a single punch has told a
OL,8,Fjury the man accused of murdering him
OL,9,F"appeared out of nowhere".
OL,11,FRebecca Mullally told Stafford Crown
OL,12,FCourt she was with Matthew O'Gara and
OL,13,Ffriends at the Ricco and Loren bar in
OL,14,FLichfield, Staffordshire, when Billy
OL,15,FAllison punched O'Gara suddenly in the
OL,16,Fhead.
OL,18,FShe described the attack, which broke
OL,19,Fseveral bones in his neck and split an
OL,20,Fartery supplying blood to the brain, as
OL,21,Fquick, loud and forceful.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
