OL,3,GNEWSAPunch that killed pub boss was
OL,4,A'loud and forceful'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAllison denies murdering O'Gara but has
OL,7,Fadmitted manslaughter. The 36-year-old
OL,8,Falso admitted inflicting grievous
OL,9,Fbodily harm against another man, Adam
OL,10,FCooper, during the same incident, but
OL,11,Fdenied doing so intentionally.
